WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.418
Hi! After reading a short story, we answer questions. Where are the answers? Today we'll read a story together and learn how to answer.

2
00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:14.922
On Sunday, Mei went to the park with Grandpa.

3
00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:19.530
She saw a little bird on the grass. It could not fly.

4
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.682
Grandpa put the bird in a box and they took it to the vet.

5
00:00:23.832 --> 00:00:29.322
A week later, the bird flew away. Mei smiled.

6
00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:34.290
Read the question first and find the key words: who, where, when.

7
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.394
Go back to the story and find the sentence with the answer.

8
00:00:38.544 --> 00:00:43.002
Some answers need thinking: Mei smiled, so she was happy.

9
00:00:43.152 --> 00:00:48.978
If asked who, give a person; if asked where, give a place.

10
00:00:49.128 --> 00:00:55.218
Watch out! The question asks where, but the answer gives a time. That's wrong!

11
00:00:55.368 --> 00:00:58.410
Where asks for a place: to the park.

12
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.226
On Sunday answers when.

13
00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:10.122
Your turn! Who went to the park with Mei? Pause and think.

14
00:01:10.272 --> 00:01:15.930
The first sentence says with Grandpa. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:23.994
Another one! When did they go to the park? Pause and think.

16
00:01:24.144 --> 00:01:29.370
The story says on Sunday. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:37.074
Here's another! Where was the bird? Pause and think.

18
00:01:37.224 --> 00:01:42.138
It says on the grass. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:42.288 --> 00:01:50.202
Try one more! What was wrong with the bird? Pause and think.

20
00:01:50.352 --> 00:01:55.842
The story says it could not fly. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:55.992 --> 00:02:03.882
Try one more! Where did they take the bird? Pause and think.

22
00:02:04.032 --> 00:02:08.874
They took it to the vet. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:09.024 --> 00:02:17.034
Try one more! How did Mei feel at the end? Pause and think.

24
00:02:17.184 --> 00:02:23.850
The bird flew away and Mei smiled, so she was happy. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:32.106
Try one more! What does the story teach us? Pause and think.

26
00:02:32.256 --> 00:02:39.258
Mei and Grandpa helped the bird, so we should be kind to animals. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:39.408 --> 00:02:47.250
Last one! Where do we find the answer? Pause and think.

28
00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:53.273
Look back in the story; don't guess. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:53.423 --> 00:03:02.393
Remember: read the question and find key words, then find the answer in the story. Who is a person, where is a place, when is a time.

30
00:03:02.543 --> 00:03:08.441
Read a little book today and ask your family to give you three questions!

